    "detailed_description": "&quot;Akairo No Kaii&quot; is a Japanese-style horror game in which the main character is a student on his way home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt has an adventure element in which the player solves a mystery by making full use of items.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is inspired by Japanese horror movies and offers a Japanese horror movie-like experience of escaping from ghosts, grudges, and other supposedly invisible fears.<br />\r\nThe game is designed to make players feel that something is going to happen, that something is out there, or that something will come out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, as the story progresses, the behavior of the enemies will change, and you will have to respond to them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Psychological Horror, Japanese Horror<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStyle: This game was inspired by Japanese horror movies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay Style: First person<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave: You can continue from a certain point by reaching a certain point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnding: Three endings are available.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Streaming, Live Streaming: Possible<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nver: 1.1.1",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Akairo No Kaii&quot; is a Japanese-style horror game in which the main character is a student on his way home.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt has an adventure element in which the player solves a mystery by making full use of items.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is inspired by Japanese horror movies and offers a Japanese horror movie-like experience of escaping from ghosts, grudges, and other supposedly invisible fears.<br />\r\nThe game is designed to make players feel that something is going to happen, that something is out there, or that something will come out.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso, as the story progresses, the behavior of the enemies will change, and you will have to respond to them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Psychological Horror, Japanese Horror<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStyle: This game was inspired by Japanese horror movies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay Style: First person<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSave: You can continue from a certain point by reaching a certain point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnding: Three endings are available.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Streaming, Live Streaming: Possible<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nver: 1.1.1",
